sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant UI as Student Learning UI
    participant Route as Student Content API
    participant Auth as Identity Adapter
    participant Policy as Course Authorization Policy
    participant Course as Course Permission Dependencies
    participant Service as Module Retrieval Service
    participant DB as SQLite Database

    Note over Route,Course: Live Module 1/2 wiring pending - Issue 23
    Note over Auth,Course: Trusted test adapters support authorized test flows

    Student->>UI: Request course learning modules
    UI->>Route: GET /api/courses/:courseId/student/modules
    Route->>Auth: Resolve authenticated user
    Auth-->>Route: Identity result

    alt Missing or invalid authentication
        Route-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
    else Authenticated user
        Route->>Policy: Authorize student course access
        Policy->>Course: Check course and enrollment
        Course-->>Policy: Course and permission result
        Policy-->>Route: Authorization decision

        alt Access denied
            Route-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
        else Course not found
            Route-->>UI: 404 Not Found
        else Permission lookup fails
            Route-->>UI: 503 Service Unavailable
        else Access granted
            Route->>Policy: Recheck course authorization
            Policy->>Course: Revalidate course and enrollment
            Course-->>Policy: Updated permission result
            Policy-->>Route: Final authorization decision

            alt Enrollment revoked or access denied
                Route-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
            else Course no longer exists
                Route-->>UI: 404 Not Found
            else Permission service unavailable
                Route-->>UI: 503 Service Unavailable
            else Authorization confirmed
                Route->>Service: Retrieve requested course modules
                Service->>DB: Query modules by course ID
                DB-->>Service: Course-specific module records
                Service->>Service: Filter published AND visible modules
                Service-->>Route: Accessible modules only
                Route-->>UI: 200 OK with modules array
            end
        end
    end

    UI-->>Student: Display accessible content or access error

    Note over Route,DB: Verified using SQLite-backed records at e59b16f
    Note over Auth,Policy: Mounted production defaults fail closed until trusted integration
